            <ArticleTitle>Radiation-induced cardiovascular dysfunction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>114-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary artery disease and valvular dysfunction are long-term complications of mediastinal irradiation. We describe 3 patients who underwent successful combined coronary artery bypass grafting and valve replacement for symptoms related to radiation-induced coronary artery and valvular disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
